"4jv_qte_5p4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m029-0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"邯","kind":"person","person_id":"4jv_qte_5p4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m029-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m029-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"雍王","kind":"person","person_id":"4jv_qte_5p4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m029-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"薛歐","kind":"person","person_id":"jit_1ud_8if","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m029-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"王吸","kind":"person","person_id":"6mx_6a9_sa9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m029-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"王陵","kind":"person","person_id":"5do_703_rfz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m029-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"太公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m029-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"呂后","kind":"person","person_id":"i30_mjq_6q8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m029-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"鄭昌","kind":"person","person_id":"vxt_uj1_8ym","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p030","text":"二年，漢王東略地，塞王欣、翟王翳、河南王申陽皆降。韓王昌不聽，使韓信擊破之。於是置隴西、北地、上郡、渭南、河上、中地郡；關外置河南郡。更立韓太尉信為韓王。諸將以萬人若以一郡降者，封萬戶。繕治河上塞。諸故秦苑囿園池，皆令人得田之，正月，虜雍王弟章平。大赦罪人。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"塞王欣","kind":"person","person_id":"o8z_o5j_2e8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"翟王翳","kind":"person","person_id":"3j2_4x7_nzr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"申陽","kind":"person","person_id":"x9l_eux_c3n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"韓王昌","kind":"person","person_id":"vxt_uj1_8ym","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"韓信","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0069","start":69,"end":73,"surface":"韓太尉信","kind":"person","person_id":"hm1_rqr_l9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"韓王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"雍王","kind":"person","person_id":"4jv_qte_5p4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"章平","kind":"person","person_id":"fs1_3m9_rj3","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:p003","text":"項籍之封諸王皆就國，韓王成以不從無功，不遣就國，更以為列侯。及聞漢遣韓信略韓地，乃令故項籍游吳時吳令鄭昌為韓王以距漢。漢二年，韓信略定韓十餘城。漢王至河南，韓信急擊韓王昌陽城。昌降，漢王乃立韓信為韓王，常將韓兵從。三年，漢王出滎陽，韓王信、周苛等守滎陽。及楚敗滎陽，信降楚，已而得亡，復歸漢，漢復立以為韓王，竟從擊破項籍，天下定。五年春，遂與剖符為韓王，王潁川。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"韓王成","kind":"person","person_id":"8i3_5vf_iu9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"hm1_rqr_l9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"鄭昌","kind":"person","person_id":"vxt_uj1_8ym","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"hm1_rqr_l9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"hm1_rqr_l9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"韓王昌","kind":"person","person_id":"vxt_uj1_8ym","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"昌","kind":"person","person_id":"vxt_uj1_8ym","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"hm1_rqr_l9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0116","start":116,"end":119,"surface":"韓王信","kind":"person","person_id":"hm1_rqr_l9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"周苛","kind":"person","person_id":"nu6_2qe_oza","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m003-0133","start":133,"end":134,